    {
      "uid": "zhcn:153a48f952887e5bc3608766",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长为了赛马娘与学园卖力的模样，\n似乎让所有工作人员的精神为之振奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "428b8b2667dc9f3c2d3decbda87cd92030601cde5646a3d4ce79cd05e0c2ff15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
