      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也受秋川理事长的热情所感动，\n忍不住心想如果能力所及，\n自己也要帮忙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7793b34f0985a4020d41db5552654287c218543c379f97227d2e62ca065b18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
