      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我朝着声音传来的方向走去，\n看到秋川理事长和学园工作人员在那里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d684e14e7a1c39e86c8174c539fdece8f20d39ad847484c9ca58d42a21c8013e",
