      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此！体积变更大，性能也更高！\n听说是本世纪的逸品，我就自掏腰包买来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde2f7cbe6a0e6eb53f316028228ad180b1756090c8d0ae461ecb31bf86d7886",
